Description: This Terraform configuration deploys an AWS ElastiCache Redis replication group using Redis ACL users. It creates a password-authenticated ElastiCache application user with two generated passwords, adds it to an ElastiCache user group, disables the default Redis user, and attaches the user group to the Redis cluster. It uses the default VPC and subnets in `us-east-1`.

